# GLM-5.3 — 744B/40B MoE (same arch/footprint as 5.2, stronger post-training). 8x B200.
#
# Was BLOCKED on Zhipu's open-weights release (safety review; missed the ~Aug 28 promise),
# with no 5.2 fallback per the 2026-08-29 decision. That blocker is CLEARED: the Hugging
# Face API, queried 2026-09-09Z, returns zai-org/GLM-5.3 as private=false, gated=false,
# sha aca966e4e027, lastModified 2026-09-04, with 141 *.safetensors files and
# safetensors.total 753,329,940,480 ({F8_E4M3: 751,226,191,872, BF16: 2,103,729,152,
# F32: 19,456}) — i.e. ~755 GB of weights, unchanged from the 8x B200 sizing this file
# already assumed. Weights, not just a config and a model card.
# Phase 1 or Phase 3 reserve is now a scheduling call, not a blocker.
HF_REPO="zai-org/GLM-5.3"
TP=8
MAX_MODEL_LEN=262144
EXTRA_ARGS="--trust-remote-code"
INSTANCE_TYPE="gpu_8x_b200_sxm6"
